This license covers the source code and the mythology/history text written for
this project. Bundled data carries its own terms:

  data/stars.json          derived from the HYG Database v4.1
                           (github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database), public domain / CC0.

  data/constellations.json the line figures derive from Stellarium's modern_iau
                           sky culture (github.com/Stellarium/stellarium), which is
                           GPL-2.0-or-later. The mythology fields in the same file
                           are original to this project and MIT as above.

  astronomy-engine         loaded from a CDN, not vendored here. MIT,
                           (c) Don Cross, github.com/cosinekitty/astronomy.
